# 本仓库只维护 UI taskbook、配套 inputs 与逐题 oracles。
*
!.gitignore
!README.md
!docs/

docs/*
!docs/ai4s-ui-taskbook-v0.1.md
!docs/inputs/
!docs/inputs/**
!docs/oracles/
!docs/oracles/README.md
!docs/oracles/*/
!docs/oracles/*/oracle.py
!docs/outputs/
!docs/outputs/.gitkeep

docs/inputs/**/__pycache__/
docs/inputs/**/*.pyc
docs/oracles/**/__pycache__/
docs/oracles/**/*.pyc
.DS_Store
